{"unit_id":"kuailexiaozixin__fasthtml-desktop#card-zh","repo":"kuailexiaozixin/fasthtml-desktop","commit":"d7c2837ca41c34098ee811b18a7ce730bdc01503","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"fasthtml-desktop 是面向 DSH Agent 的桌面应用开发技能插件，通过 Cordis Bundle 将自包含的技能注册到 ctx.skills，Agent 可在会话中调用 skill 加载工作流。它指导用户澄清需求、设计 FastHTML 与 HTMX Web 应用、用 pywebview 封装原生窗口，并以 PyInstaller 等方式打包交付。技能还提供项目初始化、界面打磨和质量门禁流程，适合希望把 Web 应用做成桌面程序的开发者。插件运行无需配置外部 API 密钥；生成项目时按技能流程使用本地 Python 工具。","source":"generated","evidence":["skills/fasthtml-desktop/index.js:1","skills/fasthtml-desktop/cordis.patch.yml:1","skills/fasthtml-desktop/SKILL.md:1"]}
{"unit_id":"kuailexiaozixin__fasthtml-desktop#card-en","repo":"kuailexiaozixin/fasthtml-desktop","commit":"d7c2837ca41c34098ee811b18a7ce730bdc01503","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"fasthtml-desktop is a DSH skill plugin. Its Cordis bundle registers a skill with ctx.skills. It guides FastHTML and HTMX development, native windows with pywebview, and PyInstaller packaging. It helps developers deliver web apps as desktop software without an external API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["skills/fasthtml-desktop/index.js:1","skills/fasthtml-desktop/cordis.patch.yml:1","skills/fasthtml-desktop/SKILL.md:1"]}
