{"unit_id":"kuailexiaozixin__fasthtml-desktop#feature-requirements","repo":"kuailexiaozixin/fasthtml-desktop","commit":"d7c2837ca41c34098ee811b18a7ce730bdc01503","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"fasthtml-desktop 的功能「桌面项目需求与架构规划」：技能引导澄清需求、定义 MVP、页面结构、数据模型和分层架构，并形成项目架构方案。用户通过会话描述目标后由 Agent 按工作流执行。","source":"generated","evidence":["skills/fasthtml-desktop/SKILL.md:1"]}
{"unit_id":"kuailexiaozixin__fasthtml-desktop#feature-webapp","repo":"kuailexiaozixin/fasthtml-desktop","commit":"d7c2837ca41c34098ee811b18a7ce730bdc01503","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"fasthtml-desktop 的功能「FastHTML 应用开发」：技能指导 Agent 使用 FastHTML 与 HTMX 构建服务端渲染 Web 界面，采用分层和业务域组织代码，并参考随包示例与模板。通过会话提出开发需求触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["skills/fasthtml-desktop/SKILL.md:1"]}
